"Configure the anti-flicker filter. ``enable`` is a bool; the optional "
"frequency arguments set the filter passband."
msgstr ""
"Mengonfigurasi filter anti-flicker. ``enable`` adalah bool; argumen "
"frekuensi opsional menetapkan pita lewat filter."

